<title>HONG KONG: HK's Deson says IPO 165 times oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>HK's Deson says IPO 165 times oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction and property concern Deson Development International Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday its initial public offering of 75 new million new shares at HK$1.00 each was 165 times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that dealings in Deson's shares would begin next on June 10.</p>
<p>The issue accounted for about 25 percent of its enlarged share capital, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
